-#
-#  The look of the tabs Alle and Nach Person und Art (documents/index,
-#  document_groups/index): the status and the timestamps centred (their
-#  headers through the columns' header_align); Person and Art in Alle
-#  wrap where a narrow page squeezes them, between words; a word too long
-#  for the column is hyphenated in Art, broken in Person (names are not
-#  hyphenated).
:css
  #main td.dmcol-subject, #main td.dmcol-kind { overflow-wrap: break-word; }
  #main td.dmcol-kind { hyphens: auto; }
  #main td.dmcol-status, #main td.dmcol-created_at,
  #main td.dgcol-first_at, #main td.dgcol-last_at { text-align: center; }
